  "why": "F438: our own round never hurts us. An enemy hit lands, then a lethal self-hit revives at once and drains back to the pre-hit pools with no death; the gun's own echoes of the revive and the drain book nothing; a later enemy kill still counts.",
  "source": "app/test/self-hit.test.mjs 'F438 (b)'",
